==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Machop|62}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Machop}}.
*'''Knuckle Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Revelation|Geodude|44}} from the {{TCG|Neo Revelation}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

